  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Programme is to contribute towards reducing the inequality and exclusion for all persons with disabilities within North Macedonia, through i) multi-stakeholder capacity building for non-discriminatory, inclusive and accountable service delivery; ii) evidence-based recommendations and proposals to improve existing legislation and policies on inclusive services, disability-sensitive budgeting and administrative data collection; and iii) facilitating both disability mai</narrative>
